      "summary_quote": "Under the new text, the Senate education committee, or the House committee that handles education subjects, could ask for a report. The request could go to the board of regents, a state university board, or the University of Tennessee board of trustees. Upon such a request, that board would have to give the requesting committee a report summarizing its grievance activities from the previous year.",
      "rationale": "The summary identifies the subsection being replaced and conveys all specified requesting committees, covered boards, the request-triggered reporting duty, the recipient, and the previous-year grievance scope."
    },
